next month marks the one-year  anniversary of nya's tragic passing and  tonight in his very first  tv interview george rivera is looking to  heal  and is feeling hopeful this as he  reveals to me  his final conversation with his dear  nyah  i'm gonna ask you a hard question you  think back to that day  we have a missing person  you talked about face timing with her  that day yeah that's  that's that was that was a hard day she  called me up when she was on the boat  and she was looking for  a place to dock so i was having her take  the camera and move it around the lake  so i could see how windy the lake was  and then the phone cut off george said  he had an awful feeling  especially after naya told him the  rented pontoon didn't have an anchor  later that day a boater found nya's then  four-year-old son josie  asleep on the boat and called 911  teams searched the area and amidst his  grief this heartbreaking moment  nya's distraught father at lake pairu  for the first time  sprinting down the dock and into the  water that moment  i needed to reconnect with the water i  needed to reconnect to where she was  and my number one goal was finding her  and i didn't know how to do it except  for  getting in the water and having a moment  after five days of searching naya's body  was discovered  josie told investigators his mom had  boosted him out of the lake  and onto the boat and then disappeared  under the water  she used her last breaths to make sure  that he was  okay what does that say to you well  sort of the same mantra she used for  life you know  keep going when things are hard you keep  pushing  right it just shows you the strength of  the person i love you  in the morning it's the afternoon  how do you talk to him about his mom  we talked to him just like he's a  five-year-old  going on sex it's no different but when  he wants to talk about his mother we  talk about his mother  nyah's ex ryan dorsey has been raising  josie with help from nya's younger  sister nikaila  mikayla and ryan are doing a really  great job there were rumors that ryan  and michaela were living together  but george says that's not true how's  ryan doing  ryan's good he's a great father  i couldn't thank ryan enough for the  father that he's become  as for george's grieving process i  couldn't look at any pictures  for naya for nine months i just recently  going through this process we're going  through now  talking about her a little bit is the  only time that i've been able  to look at some pictures he shared some  of those favorite memories with us  nya in the pool on a segway celebrating  a birthday with josie  do you see her in him oh yeah he's a  healthy happy rambunctious young man he  has that spirit of joy  how will you deal with father's day i  think this father's day is going to be  really special because we're going  through this process  this is allowing me to grieve  in terms of vocalizing our relationship  together  george also wrote nia letter he composed  it here  on a stretch of california beach they  both loved  if i die young bury me and satin  lame keep sleeping soundly my angel and  we'll take it from here  i love you and miss you but i know you  know that  love dad send me away with the words of  a love  song if i went to bed every night  thinking about what she must have gone  through grieving process is tough  i gotta tell you i see that there's joy  back in you do you feel it back  i do sleeping much better and coming to  a realization  of the breadth of her life rather than  the end of her life  i feel i can move on  i have so much respect for george and he  and i had such big plans and he said  naya's probably looking down at him  right now saying  shut up dad stop talking but this is his  way of coping  and i'm sure she understands that was an  incredible conversation it really was  man what a great match
 

